  "approval": "Owner requested the complete app UX package after the 76-route diagnosis: stable visible navigation labels, viewport-wide opaque safe-area background, contextual headers and the later approved labeled creation button in the content command bar, never the global header. Former compact/floating geometry is superseded. 19 October: chat hides navigation; creation is additionally restricted by the server-matched role matrix. Existing destinations and icons remain exact. Derived expectations require independent browser validation; no physical PWA acceptance.",
  "provenance": "Derived explicit design specification, not captured current-output approval. Safe-area and scroll probes are additionally required.",
